 END PROGRAM TEST-STEP.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-EVENTS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-NOW                 BINARY-DOUBLE VALUE 1000000.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-EVENTS               PIC X.
 01 L-COUNT                BINARY-LONG.
